[47.422, "o", "{\"advice\":\"This week, make one change: take a 10-minute brisk walk after one meal each day, preferably indoors or at the mall since your region is hazy. Start low and go slow, and if you feel chest discomfort, unusual breathlessness, dizziness, or unwell, stop and seek medical advice. Also follow up with a doctor about your High screening risk and elevated blood glucose.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[\"lg-06-exercise-by-condition\",\"lg-09-hazy-day-activity\",\"lg-10-active-after-60\",\"lg-02-physical-activity-guideline\",\"lg-05-eating-for-pre-diabetes\",\"lg-08-screening-schedule\"],\"rationale\":\"You have elevated blood glucose, low steps, low MVPA, are 60-64, and your region is hazy. The guides support a simple post-meal walk for pre-diabetes, indoor options on hazy days, and starting with comfortable activity after 60. Your High screening risk also means you should follow up with a doctor.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[\"age_60-64\",\"elevated_blood_glucose\",\"high_screening_risk\",\"low_steps\",\"low_mvpa\",\"region_hazy\",\"north_region\"]}\r\n"]
