[94.969, "o", "{\"advice\":\"Done - you're signed up for **Morning Chair Strength & Balance** at **Woodlands Community Club - Multi-purpose Hall** on **Tue 08:30**. The organiser will confirm in the Healthy 365 app. No NRIC or password is needed.\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"supporting_guides\":[\"lg-06-exercise-by-condition\",\"lg-09-hazy-day-activity\",\"lg-10-active-after-60\"],\"rationale\":\"You asked to register for the first indoor option found, and the registration was successful. This is an indoor, haze-safe, beginner-friendly activity that fits your profile in Woodlands.\",\"personalisation_flags\":[\"age_60-64\",\"north_region\",\"woodlands\",\"hazy_today\",\"elevated_blood_glucose\",\"high_screening_risk\",\"low_steps\",\"low_mvpa\"]}\r\n"]
